    "directUrl": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC13527391/",
    "annotation": "Narrative review of proposed mechanisms and clinical and preclinical evidence; not a systematic meta-analysis.",
    "doi": "10.1002/brb3.71727"
  },
  {
    "id": "guo-2026",
    "type": "article",
