    "title": "Oxiracetam improves cognitive disorder in AD by modulating AMPAR subunits GluA1/GluA2 kinetics",
    "journalOrPublisher": "Cell Biochemistry and Biophysics",
    "citation": "Guo, S., Li, T., Hu, L., Yang, N., Xiang, S., Wang, J., et al. (2026). Oxiracetam improves cognitive disorder in AD by modulating AMPAR subunits GluA1/GluA2 kinetics. Cell Biochemistry and Biophysics, 84(2), 1597–1623.",
    "doi": "10.1007/s12013-026-02025-z",
